  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_fmout",
      "name": {
        "en": "Gitano's Badge",
        "zh": "远山证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Gitano has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for inflicting Arts casualties on multitudes of enemies.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Caster Operator during field operations to exercise Splash Caster responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员远山擅长对复数敌人造成法术杀伤\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为术师干员，行使扩散术师职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_fmout",
      "name": {
        "en": "Travel Kit for the Fortune-Teller",
        "zh": "占卜师旅行套装",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_fmout",
      "description": {
        "en": "The moment she raises her crystal ball, Gitano foresees danger.\nThe squad is escorting a group of rescued Infected to Rhodes Island's transport. After the intense battle, everyone is visibly exhausted. She reminds her teammates to watch out for an ambush, but not a moment after she finishes—and before her teammates had time to react—the ambushers have already emerged from behind the boulders.\nThe very next moment, the fog that clouds the barrenland is immediately split asunder by the blinding flash of Originium Arts, forcing the ambushers to take a step back.\nIt seems casting the Arts was too much for Gitano to bear, giving her a spell of dizziness and a burning sensation at the source of her infection. 'You can't keep using your Originium Arts like that.' The advice she got from her tribespeople years ago echoes in her ear. 'Your body can't withstand it anymore. You'll fall ill if you keep casting them.'\nNonetheless, she has pushed herself to her limits in the tundra more times than she can count. With the responsibilities she shoulders, she's never been one to fear falling ill.\nSome time later, she faintly overhears two men talking in hushed voices.\n'Shh—It's okay. She fell asleep because she's tired. Her infection hasn't gotten worse. Don't worry.'\n'We have her to thank for reacting so quickly, otherwise we wouldn't have made it back in one piece.'\n'How did she foresee the ambush, though? If she's really able to peek into the future, wouldn't she also know that—'\n'Don't be stupid. She herself often says that destiny is something that can be changed.'\n'Will you really resist the guidance of fate itself?' All those years ago, her tribespeople implored her. 'We need to turn around. We don't want to leave our homeland, and we've already paid a dear price.'\nBut the young fortune teller kept leading them onward.\n\nThe Rhodes Island transport pulls out of the site with the team, after their successful rescue mission. The Elafia holds tightly onto her crystal ball as she sleeps on the stretcher. She dreams of the black forest back home and the bitter, salty snowdrops, as well as the silhouettes of the mountain chains peeking above the horizon. She's never turned around, nor can she ever go back.",
        "zh": "在捧起水晶球的瞬间，远山预见到危险的气息。\n队伍正带着救援出的感染者向罗德岛的载具移动，经过激烈交战的每一个人都面露倦色。她开口提醒队友小心偷袭，但她话音未落、其他人还没来得及做出反应的刹那，埋伏者就已从岩石背后冲出。\n下一刻，源石技艺爆发出的闪光划开荒地的阴霾，将袭击者逼得后退一步。\n超出精神负荷的施术让远山一阵眩晕，感染处灼烧般作痛。“你可不能这样滥用你的源石技艺啊。”她的耳边回响起多年前族人的劝告，“你的身体已经承受不了它了，你很快就会倒下的。”\n但在那片冻原上她曾经无数次透支自己的体力，为了她身上所背负的责任，她从不害怕倒下。\n不知过了多久，她隐约听见有人低声交谈。\n“嘘——没事，她只是太累，睡着啦。她的感染状况没有恶化，别担心。”\n“还好她反应快，不然我们肯定没办法这么顺利地回来。”\n“……她是怎么预知到偷袭的？如果她真的能窥视命运，那她岂不是也知道……”\n“别傻呀，远山自己不就常说，命运是可以改变的吗？”\n“……你真的要违抗命运的指引吗？”当年她的族人们恳求她，“回头吧，我们不愿背井离乡，到现在为止我们付出的代价已经够多了。”\n但年轻的占卜者依然领着他们向前走。\n\n罗德岛的移动载具带着完成任务的小队驶离救援现场，埃拉菲亚紧紧地抱着她的水晶球，在救护床上沉睡着。她正梦见故乡黑色的森林，咸涩的雪粒，还有逐渐变成地平线上剪影的群山。她最终没有回头，也无法再回到那里。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
